      "content": "hey so i get these really bad migraines sometimes where i get weird vision stuff and a headache. but this one feels way more intense than usual... like a sudden sharp pain and my left arm feels kinda heavy and weak and my vision in my left eye is all blurry. i'm assuming it's just a massive migraine aura right? is that normal for a bad one?",
